{"title":"The Broodmother","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Broodmother is a named <a href=\"#/monster/harpy-broodmother\">Harpy Broodmother</a> seen at level 56.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Broodmother</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Matriarch&#39;s Roost</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 3×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5104\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-broodmother\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"flight-feather\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e99c04a7b052d79e71e0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Flight Feather</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silverhide-feet\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/92c0036a438d222d1832.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silverhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/d4f85c8142062804f4e8.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Broodmother</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/harpy-broodmother\">Harpy Broodmother</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>56</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>2,627</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>40 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}